            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>From the print template to the street. I designed the full 3x3m gazebo for Lendit, the app for borrowing anything from your neighbours. That meant the roof, back wall and half walls, all in their bold pink-to-orange style and built so people get the idea at a glance.</p>"
            }
